---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant S as Trusted sender
    participant O as OCC
    participant I as OpenShell<br/>refresh service
    participant P as Provider
    Note over A,P: Renew a saved OAuth grant, even with zero Agents
    Note over I: Claim this grant
    I->>P: Exchange refresh token
    P-->>I: New token set
    Note over I: Commit successor and<br/>access token together
    Note over A,P: Send a protected request (TTL zero)
    A->>S: Request
    S->>O: Authorize and resolve
    Note over O: Check execution,<br/>target and operation
    O->>I: Resolve approved scope
    alt GitHub App grant needs a token
        I->>P: Exchange signed App JWT
        P-->>I: Scoped token
        Note over I: Verify and save
    else Static key or prepared token
        Note over I: Read current version
    end
    I-->>O: Credential and version
    Note over O: Recheck grant
    O-->>S: Credential for this send
    S->>P: Inject credential and send
    P-->>S: Response
    S-->>A: Response
